  "passage": {
    "text": "Rural communities are in the countryside. They are villages and small towns. Fifty years ago, most people in a village worked in agriculture. Now there are fewer jobs because machines do the work. Many young people moved to the city. They wanted better salaries and more opportunities. Then the school and the shop in the village closed. This is a serious problem for rural development. How can we help? We can invest in better roads and fast internet. We can support new small businesses, for example farm tourism. Then young people can stay in their villages.",
